Flowboard changes: validation only; canonical table representation; nonzero presence
bitsets instead of coefficient values; no pixel output or IDCT; strict exact block,
restart,padding,end-of-scan,spectral/refinement and input bounds; resource budgets.
No tolerant/missing-block/trailing-entropy fallback is retained.
